 ligence\nWebsite: https://www.auai.org/uai2026/\nSource URL: https://www.
 auai.org/uai2026/\nLocation: To be announced\nTopics: Probabilistic\, Cau
 sal & Uncertainty ML\, Machine Learning\, Learning Theory & Statistical F
 oundations\nSize: L\nSubmission type: Paper-based\nConfidence: estimated\
 nLast checked date: 2026-10-06\nNotes: Provisional 1-year cadence project
 ion from UAI 2026. Meeting dates\, location\, and deadlines require organ
 izer confirmation\; website and source links refer to the prior edition.\
 nScope: Learning and reasoning under uncertainty\, centered on probabilis
 tic and Bayesian modeling\, graphical models\, causal inference\, approxi
 mate inference\, and decision theory. Includes Monte Carlo and variationa
 l methods\, uncertainty quantification\, sequential models\, and principl
 ed analysis of learning algorithms. Uncertainty is the organizing theme\,
  not just another application of general-purpose AI.\nAdditional topics: 
 Deep Representation Learning\, Reinforcement Learning\, Time Series & Seq
 uential Data\, Explainability & Interpretability\, Robustness & Safety\nS
 cope sources (2026): https://www.auai.org/uai2026/subject_areas\, https:/
